WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.040
move the left gripper toward the red block.

2
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:04.020
grasp the red block with the left gripper.

3
00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:04.920
raise the red block clear of the table.

4
00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:06.720
place the red block at the base of the stack.

5
00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:07.920
release the red block onto its support.

6
00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:10.680
withdraw the left hand from the stack.

7
00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:25.800
keep the left hand steady and wait for the other hand to finish placing the supporting block.

8
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.660
move the left gripper toward the blue block.

9
00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.640
grasp the blue block with the left gripper.

10
00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:30.540
raise the blue block clear of the table.

11
00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:32.280
place the blue block on top of the existing stack.

12
00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:32.967
release the blue block onto its support.

